 * the expected semantics of:
 *
 *  - Per-host transactional replace (empty payload still wipes).
 *  - Queried-host-scoped reconcile: a host that is queried again but remediated
 *    is swept, while a host that dropped out of the run's scope (not queried)
 *    is preserved — the ANTRELAY02 regression guard.
 *  - Source-based scoping (V213): CrowdStrike vulns on human-owned assets
 *    are still cleaned up.
 *  - Severity history (V214): a CRITICAL-only run still sweeps yesterday's
